    "Assumes `fs`, `path`, `node:child_process` behave per Node.js v20+ LTS; deviations (e.g., `fs.readFileSync` returning Buffer vs string) not testable without runtime context.",
    "SHA256 digest function (`digest()`) signature and behavior (e.g., encoding, binary input handling) unknown — equality `digest(text) === a.sha256` assumed correct but unverifiable here."
  ]
